      "behavior": "Add genuine Help > debug > gui actions > make a new page in five seconds between existing long-text and delayed-popup actions. Its immutable menu command captures resolved typed default local file location at menu construction; each invocation enqueues a separate five-second monotonic page request, no early page creation. At delivery create/select a real blank query in the current notebook through existing ChangePages/Pages/SearchPage path, reading current saved tag-service default. Temporarily detach and then restore any live chooser destination/depth so the background page cannot consume its captured root/notebook/insertion anchor. Actual query and result thumbnails use the live Store. Overlapping launches retain their locations/deadlines; hidden Main existing work proceeds without raising it, while hidden new launch is refused. Share existing weak single-shot earliest deadline/200ms liveness queue with long and delayed popups, preserving all long updates, dismissal pruning and popup publication. Exit Cancel preserves work; accepted exit/rebind/Bound destruction/lost Main permanently clear requests, timer and captured consumer; retained controls cannot resurrect work.",
